WEBVTT

00:04.838 --> 00:05.755
I knew it!

00:05.922 --> 00:06.798
It's coming!

00:07.173 --> 00:08.550
The Female Titan!

00:14.681 --> 00:17.017
After making a comeback,

00:17.350 --> 00:19.227
the Female Titan took out

00:19.394 --> 00:21.271
the members of Levi Squad,
one after another.

00:27.527 --> 00:28.445
I'm going to kill her!

00:28.695 --> 00:33.158
Blaming himself for trusting his comrades,
Eren made a resolute decision.

00:33.616 --> 00:35.452
He fought in his transformed state.

00:38.371 --> 00:43.251
But the Female Titan defeated him
and took him away.

00:48.506 --> 00:49.549
Give Eren

00:50.341 --> 00:52.051
back!

01:03.396 --> 01:04.898
Wherever you are,

01:05.190 --> 01:08.943
I'm going to slaughter that woman,
butcher her body,

01:09.402 --> 01:12.614
and get you out of that foul place.

01:13.782 --> 01:15.033
Sorry, Eren.

01:15.992 --> 01:19.287
Just hang on a little longer.

01:26.920 --> 01:27.796
Wait!

01:28.630 --> 01:29.714
What?

01:32.217 --> 01:33.551
Stay back for now.

03:19.032 --> 03:20.450
Maintain this distance.

03:21.326 --> 03:24.996
She must be worn out too.
She is slowing down.

03:25.830 --> 03:28.082
It looked like
she bit the entire nape off.

03:28.791 --> 03:30.209
Is Eren dead?

03:33.379 --> 03:34.380
He's alive.

03:34.881 --> 03:36.841
The target seems intelligent

03:37.258 --> 03:39.594
and is intent on taking Eren away.

03:40.428 --> 03:42.180
It would crush him
if it wanted to kill him.

03:43.890 --> 03:47.727
Instead, it's fighting and running away
with him in its mouth.

03:49.229 --> 03:51.481
Eating Eren could be her goal.

03:51.940 --> 03:54.025
If so, he's in her stomach.

03:54.692 --> 03:56.611
Which means he's probably dead.

03:56.819 --> 03:57.820
He's alive.

04:00.490 --> 04:01.658
Let's hope so.

04:03.743 --> 04:06.746
This never would have happened
in the first place

04:06.829 --> 04:08.373
had you actually protected Eren!

04:12.085 --> 04:14.671
I see. You're that one who...

04:15.672 --> 04:17.173
You're Eren's childhood friend.

04:20.134 --> 04:21.970
Let's narrow our goals down to one.

04:22.679 --> 04:25.640
First, forget about taking her down.

04:25.723 --> 04:28.518
She has killed so many of our comrades!

04:29.477 --> 04:32.438
It's impossible. She has the ability
to harden her skin.

04:32.855 --> 04:34.274
Do as I say.

04:35.108 --> 04:38.236
We're going to set all our hopes
on Eren being alive

04:38.569 --> 04:40.738
and rescue him
before she leaves the forest.

04:41.239 --> 04:42.782
I'll do the cutting.

04:42.865 --> 04:44.367
You distract her.

05:44.052 --> 05:45.053
He's fast!

05:45.136 --> 05:47.764
She can't even harden her skin in time!

06:01.069 --> 06:02.153
Her nape...

06:02.236 --> 06:03.112
It's wide open!

06:03.780 --> 06:06.115
She's worn-down! I doubt she can move now!

06:06.991 --> 06:07.992
I can kill her!

06:11.454 --> 06:12.413
Stop!

06:27.428 --> 06:28.346
Eren!

06:35.353 --> 06:36.187
Hey!

06:37.522 --> 06:38.689
Time to go!

06:39.065 --> 06:39.982
Eren!

06:41.901 --> 06:45.446
He seems fine. He's filthy but alive.

06:46.114 --> 06:49.117
Forget about her now. We need to withdraw.

06:50.660 --> 06:53.037
Don't lose sight of
what this operation is about.

06:53.746 --> 06:56.582
Is wallowing in self-indulgence
more important?

06:57.458 --> 06:59.544
He's a dear friend to you, isn't he?

07:02.672 --> 07:05.091
No, I'm...

07:23.109 --> 07:24.735
They're coming back already?

07:26.070 --> 07:27.238
What happened?

07:27.613 --> 07:28.739
I don't know.

07:29.282 --> 07:32.660
But I bet they'll be bringing back
another load of corpses with them.

07:48.885 --> 07:51.053
It sounds like Eld is on his way back.

07:55.475 --> 07:56.601
I see.

07:59.228 --> 08:02.440
Do you think Oruo will have time
to stop by at home?

08:03.232 --> 08:06.068
I'll set a plate for him just in case!

08:10.907 --> 08:12.783
Gunther is coming back, you know.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.581
I see.

09:19.934 --> 09:21.978
This is the one thing
I'll never get used to.

09:23.271 --> 09:24.814
I doubt anyone could.

09:26.440 --> 09:28.985
How my comrades are going to die...

09:29.735 --> 09:31.529
How I'm going to die...

09:32.613 --> 09:34.865
That's all I start to think about.

09:36.117 --> 09:38.619
I try not to think about it at all.

09:39.829 --> 09:42.248
Because if I started
picturing my own death,

09:42.748 --> 09:45.710
I'd probably lose the ability to fight.

09:47.336 --> 09:48.337
Yes.

09:49.714 --> 09:51.173
You're exactly right.

09:56.637 --> 09:58.514
How long do you think we can survive?

09:59.932 --> 10:02.351
We've managed to survive so far, at least.

10:03.603 --> 10:04.979
Yes, so far.

10:05.605 --> 10:09.150
We should be glad. We're still alive.

10:10.610 --> 10:13.362
Can you say that
to the bodies of the people who died?

10:21.329 --> 10:24.332
We might never get to
see our hometowns again.

10:28.628 --> 10:29.795
We're nearly done, sir.

10:30.296 --> 10:32.673
Five bodies or so
were unrecoverable, however.

10:33.841 --> 10:35.134
Not even pieces of them?

10:35.718 --> 10:38.429
The Titans didn't leave much to recover.

10:40.222 --> 10:43.684
I feel it would be better for the families
if we don't bring back what's left.

10:45.394 --> 10:46.937
List them down as "missing."

10:47.104 --> 10:47.938
Yes, sir.

10:49.106 --> 10:52.693
We've spotted several Titans
in the vicinity of the forest,

10:53.110 --> 10:55.613
but none are headed this way yet.

10:56.113 --> 10:59.075
Let's move at once. Inform the squads.

10:59.367 --> 11:00.284
Yes, sir!

11:00.451 --> 11:02.953
I refuse to accept this, Commander Erwin!

11:03.037 --> 11:04.622
Hey, you!

11:05.122 --> 11:06.499
We should recover them!

11:06.624 --> 11:09.710
Ivan's body was right there
in front of us!

11:09.794 --> 11:11.962
There were Titans too!

11:12.254 --> 11:14.048
We could end up as casualties ourselves!

11:14.382 --> 11:17.093
Then we can just take them out
if they attack!

11:17.927 --> 11:20.346
Ivan and I grew up in the same town!

11:20.679 --> 11:22.264
I know his parents, too!

11:22.556 --> 11:24.642
I'd at least like to take him home!

11:24.809 --> 11:26.018
Quit being selfish!

11:26.102 --> 11:27.561
A bunch of brats arguing...

11:28.562 --> 11:29.730
Captain Levi!

11:30.439 --> 11:33.401
If you've confirmed his death,
then that's enough.

11:34.068 --> 11:39.198
He's dead. Whether or not we have
his body makes no difference.

11:40.074 --> 11:41.158
You can't be serious.

11:41.951 --> 11:44.370
Ivan and the others
will be put down as "missing."

11:44.787 --> 11:47.248
That decision is final. Just let it go.

11:49.250 --> 11:51.836
Do neither of you

11:52.461 --> 11:55.714
have any feelings at all?

11:55.798 --> 11:58.551
Hey, Dieter! Watch what you're saying!

12:33.544 --> 12:34.378
Titans!

12:42.386 --> 12:43.304
That's

12:45.264 --> 12:46.223
Dieter!

12:50.436 --> 12:51.562
That idiot!

12:55.065 --> 12:56.650
Titan spotted by the rear!

12:57.985 --> 12:59.069
Full speed!

12:59.653 --> 13:02.615
I don't see any large trees or buildings.

13:03.532 --> 13:05.201
We can't fight freely out here.

13:05.826 --> 13:07.828
Fleeing to the wall will be quicker.

13:34.563 --> 13:36.190
It's about to catch up to us!

13:36.607 --> 13:38.400
We're going to have to fight!

13:38.943 --> 13:41.362
Omnidirectional mobility gear
won't be useful on flat ground.

13:41.820 --> 13:42.905
Plus, look.

13:43.697 --> 13:44.698
They just keep coming!

13:45.783 --> 13:48.577
Then what do you suggest we do?

13:51.080 --> 13:52.414
We need to...

14:28.367 --> 14:29.827
It's no use! It's catching up!

14:30.160 --> 14:31.662
I'll get behind it and distract it!

14:31.745 --> 14:34.415
- Use that chance--
- Don't bother.

14:35.124 --> 14:37.877
Dump the bodies before it catches up.

14:38.752 --> 14:40.004
But sir!

14:40.504 --> 14:43.883
There have been countless people before
whose bodies were left behind.

14:44.550 --> 14:46.802
These ones aren't somehow special.

14:48.095 --> 14:49.179
Are we going to do it?

14:50.014 --> 14:51.557
Are we really going to do it?

14:56.020 --> 14:57.146
Damn...

14:59.815 --> 15:01.442
We have no other choice!

15:30.804 --> 15:31.889
That's it!

15:32.556 --> 15:34.183
Keep moving!

15:46.195 --> 15:48.864
We'll leave as soon as
we have confirmed our positions!

15:49.031 --> 15:50.407
Stay sharp!

15:50.950 --> 15:53.577
We need to make
a slight course correction to the east.

16:02.086 --> 16:03.420
Captain Levi.

16:04.630 --> 16:05.589
I...

16:09.343 --> 16:11.637
This is proof that they once lived.

16:13.055 --> 16:14.431
That's how I see it, anyway.

16:19.311 --> 16:20.562
It's Ivan's.

16:26.735 --> 16:27.820
Captain...

16:44.962 --> 16:46.505
Let's move out!

17:05.983 --> 17:09.153
Eren, I'd forget about joining
the Scout Regiment if I were you.

17:10.195 --> 17:13.115
What? You think the Scout Regiment
is a joke too?

17:13.699 --> 17:16.243
It's not about what I think.

17:23.250 --> 17:25.294
The Scout Regiment is back!

17:25.711 --> 17:27.171
They're going to open the front gate!

17:27.379 --> 17:29.715
Let's go and see
the heroes return, Mikasa!

17:49.443 --> 17:51.820
They're the only ones who made it back?

17:52.488 --> 17:54.656
Everyone else must have gotten eaten.

17:55.199 --> 17:58.202
This is what they get
for going outside the walls.

17:58.744 --> 18:03.040
Our taxes are basically going to feed
and fatten those things up now.

18:03.874 --> 18:04.708
Eren.

18:09.671 --> 18:10.631
What's wrong?

18:19.598 --> 18:20.432
Eren.

18:26.313 --> 18:27.147
Eren!

18:36.406 --> 18:37.366
Eren?

18:43.914 --> 18:45.290
You shouldn't get up yet.

18:46.500 --> 18:47.709
You need to rest.

18:49.128 --> 18:50.045
Where's the Female Titan?

18:51.588 --> 18:52.548
She got away.

18:53.757 --> 18:54.716
Why?

18:55.425 --> 18:57.845
Why did everyone...

18:58.846 --> 19:00.055
What about the operation?

19:01.098 --> 19:02.307
It failed.

19:03.142 --> 19:04.476
You need to rest for now.

19:07.312 --> 19:08.272
How did I get this?

19:09.731 --> 19:12.609
Did you save me again?

19:16.613 --> 19:19.199
We're almost at the Wall now.

19:37.384 --> 19:40.095
Is it me, or are there
fewer than this morning?

19:41.346 --> 19:42.931
A lot fewer.

19:43.682 --> 19:45.475
Another bad one...

19:46.935 --> 19:50.939
They left this morning shouting
and roaring, and now they're already back?

19:51.148 --> 19:52.816
What did they even leave for?

19:53.275 --> 19:54.526
Beats me.

19:55.194 --> 19:59.489
But from the brooding looks
on their faces,

19:59.823 --> 20:03.577
I'd say they succeeded in
pouring our tax money down the drain.

20:06.747 --> 20:08.790
Eren, endure it.

20:19.885 --> 20:21.178
So cool!

20:21.386 --> 20:23.347
The Scout Regiment is awesome!

20:23.972 --> 20:26.975
Even when they're so beat-up,
they keep on fighting!

20:47.579 --> 20:48.872
Captain Levi, sir!

20:49.665 --> 20:51.458
Thanks for looking after my daughter!

20:51.792 --> 20:53.210
I'm Petra's father!

20:53.460 --> 20:56.213
I'd like to discuss something
before she spots me.

20:57.256 --> 20:59.800
She sent me a letter, you see.

21:00.217 --> 21:03.428
She said she was assigned to your squad
because you recognized her skill.

21:04.054 --> 21:06.765
She said she wants
to devote her life to you.

21:07.099 --> 21:08.934
Basically, the girl is so starry-eyed

21:09.017 --> 21:11.728
that she has no idea
how worried her parents are!

21:13.522 --> 21:17.067
So, as her father, you see...

21:17.567 --> 21:20.862
I feel it's a bit too early
to let her get married.

21:20.946 --> 21:24.491
She's still young
and has so much to experience.

21:25.033 --> 21:26.159
Commander Erwin!

21:26.326 --> 21:27.786
Please answer us!

21:28.078 --> 21:31.915
Were the gains from this expedition
worth the number of lives lost?

21:32.040 --> 21:35.210
Do you honestly believe
the soldiers died without regrets?

21:38.755 --> 21:43.427
The costs and casualties incurred
by this latest exterior expedition

21:43.677 --> 21:47.973
dealt a blow heavy enough
to destroy the Scout Regiment's support.

21:57.899 --> 22:02.821
Erwin and the others in charge
found themselves summoned to the capital

22:04.031 --> 22:06.408
and ordered to hand over Eren.

23:43.213 --> 23:45.966
Annie is assigned
to the security escort team

23:46.049 --> 23:48.593
the day Eren and the others
are summoned to the royal capital.

23:49.010 --> 23:52.055
From out of nowhere, Armin appears

23:52.139 --> 23:56.059
and asks for her help
in a top-secret operation.
